========================================================
PROJECT: BAKERY E-COMMERCE PLATFORM
========================================================

PURPOSE:
A full-stack, microservices-based bakery application that supports
online cake ordering, table booking, real-time tracking, and scalable deployment.

--------------------------------------------------------
ARCHITECTURE STYLE:
--------------------------------------------------------
- Microservices Architecture
- Event-Driven System (Kafka)
- Saga Pattern (Orchestration)
- REST + Async Communication
- Distributed System Design

--------------------------------------------------------
TECH STACK:
--------------------------------------------------------

BACKEND:
- Java 17 (Temurin)
- Spring Boot 3.5.13
- Spring Cloud 2024.0.1
- Spring Security (JWT)

FRONTEND:
- React (SPA)

DATABASE:
- MySQL (per service DB)

CACHING:
- Redis

MESSAGING:
- Apache Kafka

COMMUNICATION:
- REST (Feign Client)
- Async Events (Kafka)

DEPLOYMENT:
- Docker
- AWS (ECS / EKS)
- CI/CD (GitHub Actions / Jenkins)

--------------------------------------------------------
MICROSERVICES OVERVIEW:
--------------------------------------------------------

1. API Gateway
2. Auth Service
3. Product Service
4. Cart Service
5. Order Service
6. Payment Service
7. Inventory Service
8. Review Service
9. Table Booking Service
10. Notification Service

--------------------------------------------------------
SECURITY DESIGN:
--------------------------------------------------------

- JWT-based Authentication
- Stateless Sessions
- Centralized Validation (API Gateway)
- Role-based Authorization (USER / ADMIN)

FLOW:
1. User logs in → JWT generated
2. Client sends JWT in header
3. Gateway validates token
4. Request forwarded to services

--------------------------------------------------------
API GATEWAY:
--------------------------------------------------------

PURPOSE:
Single entry point + centralized security

FEATURES:
- JWT validation
- Request routing
- Global filter (WebFlux)
- Exception handling
- Logging

--------------------------------------------------------
AUTH SERVICE:
--------------------------------------------------------

PURPOSE:
Handles authentication and token generation

FEATURES:
- User registration
- Login validation
- JWT generation
- BCrypt password hashing
- Role management

DATABASE:
- users (id, name, email, password, role)

--------------------------------------------------------
PRODUCT SERVICE:
--------------------------------------------------------

PURPOSE:
Manages bakery products and catalog

FEATURES:
- Fixed cake flavors (5 types)
- Get all products
- Get product by ID
- Redis caching

CACHE:
- Product list cache
- Individual product cache

DATABASE:
- product (id, name, price, description, available)

--------------------------------------------------------
CART SERVICE:
--------------------------------------------------------

PURPOSE:
Manages user cart

FEATURES:
- Add to cart
- Remove from cart
- Update quantity
- Fetch cart items

INTEGRATION:
- Uses Product Service (Feign)

DATABASE:
- cart
- cart_items

--------------------------------------------------------
ORDER SERVICE:
--------------------------------------------------------

PURPOSE:
Handles order placement and orchestration

FEATURES:
- Place order
- Apply coupon
- Saga orchestration
- Order tracking

FLOW:
1. Validate cart
2. Reserve inventory (Kafka)
3. Process payment (Kafka)
4. Confirm order

DATABASE:
- orders
- order_items

--------------------------------------------------------
PAYMENT SERVICE:
--------------------------------------------------------

PURPOSE:
Handles payment processing

FEATURES:
- Mock payment (Phase 1)
- Success / Failure simulation
- Kafka event publishing

DATABASE:
- payment

--------------------------------------------------------
INVENTORY SERVICE:
--------------------------------------------------------

PURPOSE:
Manages stock and prevents overselling

FEATURES:
- Stock tracking
- Reserved stock handling
- Concurrency control (locks)

TECH:
- ReentrantLock
- Redis lock (future)

DATABASE:
- inventory (product_id, stock, reserved_stock)

--------------------------------------------------------
REVIEW SERVICE:
--------------------------------------------------------

PURPOSE:
Manages ratings and feedback

FEATURES:
- Add review
- One review per order
- Rating aggregation

DATABASE:
- review (user_id, product_id, rating, comment)

--------------------------------------------------------
TABLE BOOKING SERVICE:
--------------------------------------------------------

PURPOSE:
Handles table reservations in bakery

FEATURES:
- Slot-based booking
- Concurrency control
- Prevent double booking

TECH:
- ReentrantLock
- Redis distributed lock

DATABASE:
- tables
- table_booking

CONSTRAINT:
- Unique (table_id + slot_time)

--------------------------------------------------------
NOTIFICATION SERVICE:
--------------------------------------------------------

PURPOSE:
Handles communication with users

FEATURES:
- Order confirmation
- Booking confirmation
- Inventory alerts

TECH:
- Kafka consumer
- Async processing

--------------------------------------------------------
EVENT-DRIVEN ARCHITECTURE:
--------------------------------------------------------

KAFKA TOPICS:
- order-created
- inventory-reserved
- payment-processed
- order-confirmed
- order-failed
- notification-trigger
- table-booking-created

--------------------------------------------------------
SAGA PATTERN (ORDER FLOW):
--------------------------------------------------------

1. Order Created
2. Inventory Reserved
3. Payment Processed
4. Order Confirmed

FAILURE HANDLING:
- Payment fail → release inventory
- Inventory fail → cancel order

--------------------------------------------------------
REDIS USAGE:
--------------------------------------------------------

- Product caching
- Coupon caching
- Order tracking
- Table locking (future)

--------------------------------------------------------
CONCURRENCY DESIGN:
--------------------------------------------------------

- ReentrantLock → Inventory & Table booking
- CompletableFuture → Parallel processing
- ExecutorService → Async notifications

--------------------------------------------------------
EXCEPTION HANDLING:
--------------------------------------------------------

- Global exception handlers
- Custom exceptions:
  - UnauthorizedException
  - ResourceNotFoundException
  - PaymentFailedException

STANDARD RESPONSE:
- status
- data
- error

--------------------------------------------------------
LOGGING:
--------------------------------------------------------

- Request logs
- Error logs
- Kafka event logs
- Correlation ID (future)

--------------------------------------------------------
SCALABILITY DESIGN:
--------------------------------------------------------

- Stateless services
- Independent databases
- Async communication
- Horizontal scaling (Docker + AWS)

--------------------------------------------------------
FUTURE ENHANCEMENTS:
--------------------------------------------------------

- OAuth2 (Spring Authorization Server)
- WebSocket (real-time tracking)
- ELK stack (logging)
- Rate limiting (Gateway)
- Circuit breaker (Resilience4j)
- Recommendation engine

--------------------------------------------------------
SUMMARY:
--------------------------------------------------------

This system is a production-grade, distributed bakery platform
built using microservices, event-driven architecture, Saga pattern,
and modern cloud-native technologies.

